{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 22, :comments ["<b>Israel is My firstborn son.</b> Even though at the end of days I will turn the peoples to a pure language, to call all of them by the name of YHWH and to serve Him with one accord (Zephaniah 3:9), nevertheless Israel will be considered by Me more honored than all of them, in that he is My son — serving like a son out of love, not as a servant out of love of reward and fear of punishment. And in that he is My firstborn — the first to My service — while all the nations go astray from Me, as it says: כִּי כָל הָעַמִּים יֵלְכוּ אִישׁ בְּשֵׁם אֱלֹהָיו, וַאֲנַחְנוּ נֵלֵךְ בְּשֵׁם ה' אֱלֹהֵינוּ לְעוֹלָם וָעֶד וְכוּ׳ (Micah 4:5)."], :book :exodus, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 4, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:24:26.033376620Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}